handler reads the body after its answer (prefix 5000 of 20000)
  response to the client: 200
  client: tail written
  handler: bytes 20000, clean ends 1, errs 0
handler reads the body after its answer, the client having said Connection: close
  response to the client: 200
  client: tail written
  handler: bytes 20000, clean ends 1, errs 0
handler reads a body of 1,000,000 slowly after its answer
  response to the client: 200
  client: tail written
  handler: bytes 1000000, clean ends 1, errs 0
handler drops a body of 100,000 after its answer
  response to the client: 200
  client: tail written
  client: second request answered: kept
handler drops a body of 400,000 after its answer
  response to the client: 200
  client: tail written
  client: no answer to the second request: closed
the peer leaves in the middle of the body while the handler is yet to read it
  response to the client: 200
  client: left
  handler: bytes 5000, clean ends 0, errs 1
  err text: http: closed: the connection closed in the middle of a body
